          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Any person, not covered under sub-section (1) may apply to the Assessing Officer for the allotment of a Permanent Account Number after which the Assessing Officer shall allot a Permanent Account Number to such person.",
          "clauses": [],
